> There are two sockets for flash ROMs on the card: U34 and U47. U34 is
> empty, and U47 is labled:
> 
>    615156-F02
>    V2.42
>    U47
>    DEC

If you are using Bios/Firmware 2.x then it is limited to 32GB per system
drive. It means that each and every system drive will not exceed 32GB.
But if you are using 3.X firmware, then this kind of limitation does not
apply. But the 2-chip version of the mlx controller ist required to use
the 3.X firmware

